<title>FINLAND: HELIBOR INTEREST RATES MIXED AT FIX.</title>
<headline>HELIBOR INTEREST RATES MIXED AT FIX.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-12-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Helibor rates were mixed at the</p>
<p>Bank of Finland's daily fixing on Monday with shorter rates</p>
<p>higher and longer rates lower.</p>
<p>					Dec 30 fix	  Dec 27 fix</p>
<p> 1-mth Helibor		     3.05 pct	    3.02 pct</p>
<p> 2-mth Helibor		     3.05 pct	    3.05 pct</p>
<p> 3-mth Helibor		     3.09 pct	    3.08 pct</p>
<p> 6-mth Helibor		     3.19 pct	    3.20 pct</p>
<p> 9-mth Helibor		     3.29 pct	    3.30 pct</p>
<p> 12-mth Helibor		    3.37 pct	    3.39 pct</p>
<p>-- Helsinki Newsroom +358-9-680 50 245</p>
</text>
